    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Zero",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For a bar magnet, the work done in turning from parallel to antiparallel&nbsp;position relative to the field direction is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>, here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p>"
  }
